# ============================================================================
# File:        PrinterMonitor.PackageInfo
# Project:     haiku-printer-monitor
# Component:   packaging
# Description: Package metadata for the Haiku package (.hpkg). The Makefile
#              "package" target fills in @VERSION@ and @ARCH@.
